{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"O-oh, thank God... sorry to ask, I'm just scared","Thanks for not being mad, I had to check","Let me see... slow, nice and slow","Clean, you're clean, oh, thank God, thank you","I'm sorry, I'm so sorry, I didn't mean to insult you","Okay, you're fine, you're fine, sorry, I'm shaking","That's a relief, honestly, a huge relief!","Thank you, I feel better already","You look fine... yeah, you look fine!","Thanks for putting up with that","Whew, okay, nothing, good, good","Sorry, but you understand, right?","I had to ask, everyone's got to ask","Okay... great -- thank you","Okay, here, look, nothing, no bites, no scratches, see?","There, my arms, look, look as long as you want, I'm clean"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"Thank you, I'll sleep better tonight"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good, thank you, it's routine, don't take it hard","Alright, sleeves up, let me see","Clean, thanks, that's all I needed","Fine, now we can talk..","Good -- I don't take chances","Right, that's done, we're good","Cooperative, I like that","Thanks... I'll return the favor","Okay... you're clear..","Clean. Sleeves down, we're fine","Standard procedure, no offense","Good, no marks, no worry","Fine, let's move on","Alright, that's settled","Thank you, now I can breathe","Alright, sleeves up, see for yourself","There, happy? Not a mark"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"I'm sorry I had to ask, truly","Better to look now than be sorry later","I trust you, I did, but I had to look!","Relief, honestly, thank you","You're a good sport"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Slowly, don't make any sudden moves","Good, keep your hands where I can see them","Okay, but I'm not convinced yet","Show me the other arm, too"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Go on, dear, look all you want"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Check, you won't find anything"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Inspect, I'm clean"}},
