{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"Turn them over... oh thank God, sorry, thank you"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=careful",{"Slow - other side - alright - clean, you can come a little closer now","Sleeves higher - higher - fine, I've seen folks hide one right up by the elbow"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","role=family_woman,family_man|st=careful",{"Thank you - I'm sorry, my kids are right inside, I have to be sure"}},
{"SHOW_ARMS","reg=worker|st=careful",{"Turn 'em - yeah - good, no offense, the last fella had one under a bandana"}},
