{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, thank you, thank you, I was so scared to be out there","You'd let me STAY? Oh, bless you","O- okay, okay, I'll be quiet, I promise, I'll be so quiet","That's, wow, that's the nicest thing, thank you","Thank you, I didn't know where else to go!","I won't be any trouble, really- I mean it, I won't","You have no idea what this means","Okay, yes, thank you, yes","Thank you for trusting me","I... thank you, I didn't think anyone would","I'll keep watch if you want... I'm too wired to sleep","I'm so grateful... thank you","That's a kindness I won't forget","Thank you, thank you, thank you","Oh good, thank God, I'll get you a blanket, smells like dog, sorry","Thank you, thank you for accepting, I wasn't looking forward to the dark alone","Really? You'll stay? I'm so relieved, I'll make a little room right now","Thank you, thank you, I'll sleep with one eye open, but thank you","Really? Wow, okay, I'll be quiet as a mouse, you won't hear me"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"I'll stay by the door, I'll stay out of the way"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good, the more the safer, in a way","Sensible, it's no night to be out","Good, you'll take a watch, by the way","Welcome, then, for one night","Settle in, and keep it down","All right, one night. We'll talk in the morning","Okay... there's water in the jug, bread on the shelf","Very well, make yourself small","That's agreed, then","Fine, fine, no fuss","Good, let's all get some sleep, if we can","Good, I'll show you where to sleep, don't wake the baby","You're in, but you're on watch at three","I'll take the floor, I've slept on worse","Appreciate it, I won't be any trouble"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=door",{"Alright, you take the corner, I take the door"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=4,9",{"Fine... but we leave at first light"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"You can have the couch, if you don't mind the springs","Good, take the spot by the wall, and keep your boots on"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"Then it's decided, you're our guest tonight"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Wonderful! It'll be lovely to have you","Oh, come in, come in, you'll catch your death","Course you can, sit down, we'll feed you","I'm so glad you said yes!"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|hour=16,5",{"You're family tonight"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"One night, and that's all","You'll sleep where I can see you","Don't make me regret it"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|world=door",{"Fine, but leave your weapons by the door"}},
