{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Alright, one night, and if I wake up with something missing, I'll find you"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Good, I'm glad, it'll be nice to not be the only one awake"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Aight, but you sleep light, and when I say get up, you get up"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Yeah, there's room. We take turns keeping watch"}},
{"STAY_NIGHT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Alright, {g:brother|sister}, floor's yours, don't wake the president"}},
