{"SURRENDER","",{"Alright, face down, arms out - don't talk, and this stays boring for both of us","Then you live - set it down, back up three steps, eyes on me","Then we've got no problem, empty that bag on the ground and stand away from it","Good answer, the wrong one costs a lot more and takes a lot longer","Alright, walk backwards toward my voice and don't turn around while you do it"}},
{"SURRENDER","world=road",{"Okay, nobody's hurting you - sit on that curb and put your hands under your legs"}},
{"SURRENDER","tmp=predator",{"Smart, see, he's smart, everybody watch how the smart ones do it"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"O- okay, okay, so, um, where was I","So... here's the thing","Alright, I'll tell you, but promise you won't judge!!","Nobody ever listens, so... thanks","Okay. Nothing came of it, nothing ever does. I looked for two days, then I quit, and that's the part I can't forgive","Oh, you want to hear? Okay, I'm nervous","Well, since you asked so nicely","Okay. There's no more to it, and that's the awful part. I went back the next day and everything was where I'd left it","Alright, I'll try to explain, bear with me!","Nice of you to want to know","So, it started like this","Okay. Nobody ever came to explain it. I waited till dark, then picked up my bag and walked on like nothing happened","I haven't told this to anyone, so, be kind","Where do I even start?","That's all of it. I told one person and they laughed, so now I only tell strangers","I'll tell you, it's just... hard to say out loud","But don't judge me, please, I was scared, I was so scared","Where was I... yeah... okay"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fine, but it isn't pretty","That's the rest. It didn't end, it just stopped, and I've been waiting on the other half ever since","Alright, short version, then","I'll give it to you straight","Okay, you asked for it","Here's the rest, then","Short version of the rest: nothing happened, and that's what I can't get over","Fine, but don't interrupt","Well, the short version goes like this","Pay attention, this matters..","Well, since you're curious","The rest is that I went back. I knew better, and it was exactly what I thought it'd be","Alright, I'll tell you","Right, where was I","The rest is easy to say. We buried what we could find and drew straws for who'd say something over it","The rest is that nobody came. We waited three days, then left a note, which tells you what we thought of our chances","The rest is worse than the start. I won't dress it up: we left, and we didn't go back for them","Why not? Keeping it in hasn't done me any good"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Oh, I'd love to, nobody asks","I'm glad you want to know, truly","There isn't much more. I kept the one thing I found, and I look at it more than I should","Aw -- you're so sweet to listen!","Let's sit and talk, shall we?"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Fine, but not too much","Short version only","Make it quick","Okay, but you don't get details"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Well, dear, the rest is short and sad. We said the words over it, and that was the end of it"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Here's the rest"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Here's the rest of it"}},
{"TELL_MORE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ha, you want more? Pour me a drink first"}},
{"TELL_MORE","",{"So, where was I... yeah","Okay, but this is the last of it, I've got things need doing","Good, 'cause I've been wanting to say it out loud to somebody","The rest of it's short. Nobody came back, and I kept a place set at the table for a week anyhow","Alright, I'll tell it, but I'll tell it my way and you'll let me finish","Okay, hold on - let me start it over, I got ahead of myself","Sure, I'll warn you, though - it don't have an ending yet","Good, most folks change the subject right about here","Hold on, let me get a drink of water first","Yeah? Okay, okay - nobody's asked me for the rest of it before"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, good, good, alright, let's see what you've got","O- okay -- okay, I don't have much, but let's try","Great... I hope we can find something fair","Yes? Wonderful, I was nervous you'd say no","Show me then! I'm excited and scared both","So how does this work? I'm no good at deals","Good... good, let's be quick, let's be quiet","Perfect... I need a few things -- and I think you might have them","Okay -- I'll be honest with you, I'm desperate, so be gentle!!","Thank you, thank you for even considering it","Right, let's take a look, then","Great, I'll get my things","Terrific, let's both come out ahead","Alright -- deal, I'm ready when you are","Okay... okay, let's do this","Good- put yours down first, no wait, mine first- ugh, you go","Oh, thank God, I was scared you'd say no, let's do it, quick, before someone shows up","Deal, deal, fine, but if you try anything I'll scream, I'm serious, I'll scream","Alright, show me, and be gentle, I'm no good at haggling","Okay!! Good, I'm so glad, let's do it quick before I lose my nerve","Great, great, thank you, God, I was so afraid you'd say no"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good, let's see what's on the table","Fine, no haggling for sport, I'm tired","Alright, put your cards down, I'll put mine","Then let's get to it, daylight's burning","Reasonable, let's see the goods","Good, I like a straight dealer","Right, nothing fancy, just a swap","Okay, show me what you've got","Let's keep it fair, and keep it quick","Good, I need a few things and you probably do too","Deal, then, in principle","Alright, I'm listening","Let's see if we can help each other","Fine, but I know the going rate","Good... trading's the only honest business left","Show me what you've got and I'll tell you what I think","Deal, but hands where I can see them, you know how it is","Good, let's keep it simple, no tricks, no games","Lay it out, slow, where I can see it","Show me what you've got then, and keep your hands visible","Let's trade, one at a time, slow and honest"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Wonderful, let's make it a good one, for both of us!","Sure thing, you know I'll be fair","Oh, I'm so pleased, come, let's sit and talk","Friend, I'd trade with you any day!","Excellent, I have a few things I think you'll like"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Alright, but no tricks","Okay, but I'll count everything twice","Fine, but keep your hands where I can see them","We'll see if you're honest","Let's make it quick, I'm uneasy"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=careful,neutral",{"Slowly, then, I'm watching your hands the whole time","But any funny business and the deal's off"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=family|st=friendly,neutral",{"Wonderful, honey, wonderful, let's get it done before supper gets cold","Oh good, I'm glad, we can all use a little help, can't we?","Wonderful, dear, let's get it done"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"But I'm watching how you handle it","Alright, show me what you have, nice and open","Go ahead, slow, hands where I can see 'em"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=military,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Understood, proceed, one item at a time","Good, state terms, I'll state mine","Understood, proceed"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Ha, now you're talking, what's the price? And no cheating","Good, I like a person who knows how to deal, show me","But I get first pick, house rules","Heh, I like you, now let's see what you've got","But no funny business, I'm watching"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"But you go first, I trust no one","Good, but I'm keeping my hand on this, just in case","Show me first, I trust no one"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh",{"Good, put it down there and I'll put mine next to it, we pick up at the same time"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|world=road",{"Nice and slow, your stuff on the hood, mine on the curb"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thank you, you don't know what this means, the baby hasn't slept in two days"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Pleasure doing business - don't tell anybody I'm this soft"}},
{"TRADE_OFFER","reg=worker,civilian",{"Fair's fair - shake on it? No? Right, hands, nobody shakes hands anymore"}},
