{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Oh, good, I hate walking alone, I hate it","Let's go then, but quietly, please","Yes? Thank you, I'd feel so much safer","Stay close, I'll stay close too","Wonderful, then, which way are we going?","Thank you, I'm a little nervous, but that's okay","Let's go slow, and listen, and be careful","O- okay, we're a team, aren't we?","I'm glad... I'm really glad","It's nice to have someone, even for a little while","Right, let's keep our voices low","Good, good, let's NOT waste time!","You lead, I'll follow, or I'll lead, whichever","I won't talk much, I promise, I'll just walk","Thank you... truly","Okay, but let's go slowly, I get nervous when we move fast","Yes, please, walking with someone feels so much safer, thank you","You go first, no, wait, I'll go first, no, you, ugh, I'm useless"}},
{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good, two sets of eyes are better than one","Alright, let's move, keep your steps soft","Fine, you take the left, I take the right","Okay, eyes up, mouths shut","Good, walk where I walk","Sensible, let's go","Alright, partner, for now..","Then keep up and don't talk","Good, I could use the company","Fine, but if I say stop, we stop","Right, off we go","Let's do it, then","Mm, I'd rather have a witness anyway","Glad to have you along...","A mile or two, that's all","Sure, but we stop when I say we stop, deal?","Let's move, keep your eyes open"}},
{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Lovely! It's nice to have a friend along","Oh, I'd love that, truly!!","Come on, then, we'll make good time","This will be pleasant, I can tell!","Let's walk and talk, shall we?"}},
{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Fine, but STAY two steps behind me!","Okay, but don't try anything","We walk, we don't talk, understand?","I'll tolerate it for a while"}},
