{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Yeah, let's roll, it's safer with two"}},
{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Alright, {g:brother|sister}, we'll walk a bit, but I set the pace","Fine, but we split at the first fork"}},
{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Gladly, {g:brother|sister}, I could use the company"}},
{"WALK_TOGETHER","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Very well, as far as the next corner, and not a step further","Acceptable, though I'd prefer you walk on my left"}},
